{2540}{}{[His jaw drops in utter shock.] You did what?! Are you saying our tormentors are gone? The war is truly ended? The NCR emerged triumphant in the end? [He gazes into the distance, overwhelmed.] I can't believe I've witnessed this day. This victory is a testament to my leadership, and your remarkable "problem-solving" abilities, hero. You are the hero. You. [He jabs his finger towards you, reminiscent of the gesture you've seen in pre-war military posters with some old man.] And a hero deserves nothing less than the tools of a hero. I'll arrange for a Gauss rifle or a Bozar to be sent to you immediately. And a nice shack on the Rim. What a day. Historic. A day that our forefathers dreamt of, a day that our children's children will remember, a day... [He disappears from the monitor's screen.]}
